WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Good conversations. Worth keeping.
Bring the useful part with you.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Your chat. Your format.
TXT, Markdown, HTML, JSON and PDF.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Code. Tables. Images, too.
Choose user images and AI response images for HTML/PDF.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Long chats. Smaller files.
Large direct ChatGPT HTML/PDF exports split into numbered parts.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Build your chat library.
Select saved ChatGPT chats for a text-only ZIP archive.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Know what made it.
Successful chats are kept. Skipped chats have reasons.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Local by design.
No developer uploads, analytics or telemetry.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Dialogue Export. Keep the conversation.
github.com/vaulthunt3r/dialogue-export
